  "custom_logic_notes": "SL/TP are specified in POINTS (not pips) via InpStopLoss=300 and InpTakeProfit=600, multiplied directly by SymbolInfoDouble(SYMBOL_POINT). No digit-adjustment logic exists, so on 5-digit brokers 300 points = 30 pips. Time filter allows trading during London (8-16) or New York (13-21) sessions in broker server time. Position check uses custom PositionSelectByMagic() which scans all positions for matching symbol+magic — only one position allowed at a time. Signal uses bar index [1] (last completed candle) to prevent repainting, with stochastic crossover confirmed on bars [2] and [1].",
